    "ImageDescription": {
      "value": "Flag seen in a photograph of Revolutionary Russian sailors of Russian Imperial Navy battleship Petropavlovsk in Helsinki during summer 1917. The flag shows a spear and a scythe crossed over eachother, as well as a skull and crossbones above and below the spear and scythe. The top of the flag has the text \"смерть буржуямъ\" (\"smert' burzhuyam\") (en: \"Death to the Bourgeois\")",
